      "original_sha256": "009b1a6cb93efbb969dba5090d683279c81fc8c6a687ac92e302330b89eeac40",
      "text": "Every November, the same email arrives: \u201cOpen enrollment closes Friday.\u201d Four years running, I clicked \u201cKeep my current plan\u201d in about four seconds. This year, I spent forty minutes checking the numbers instead. My normal-year comparison revealed a potential difference of one thousand nine hundred and eighty dollars. And I nearly clicked straight past it.",
      "processed": "processed/s001-009b1a6cb93e.wav",
