      "original_sha256": "ede057ce08a22a1db28f1fb104e1a7b0f4788e7600c2bfd247bd46bd889cf03f",
      "text": "Then this year's email added a sentence: \u201cYour premium contribution will increase.\u201d Mine was going from one hundred and eighty-five to two hundred and ten dollars a month.",
